  data: {
    LLM: "Save your big tiles (6-6, 1-1, 4-4) for the end. It doesn't matter if you lose the first 15 tricks as long as you have the highest tile for the 16th.\n\nExhaust the opponent's 'Civil' suit early. If you have many Military tiles, lead them to force out your opponents' big Civil tiles so they can't use them to win the final trick.\n\nSet Detection: If an opponent leads a 'Double Pair', they are signaling they have a deep hand. You must decide whether to challenge them now or save your tiles to 'bury' theirs later.",
    Player: "Save your big tiles (6-6, 1-1, 4-4) for the end. It doesn't matter if you lose the first 15 tricks as long as you have the highest tile for the 16th.\n\nExhaust the opponent's 'Civil' suit early. If you have many Military tiles, lead them to force out your opponents' big Civil tiles so they can't use them to win the final trick.\n\nSet Detection: If an opponent leads a 'Double Pair', they are signaling they have a deep hand. You must decide whether to challenge them now or save your tiles to 'bury' theirs later.",
